# ── Maintainer docs (.local-docs/) ──────────────────────────────────────────
# DENY BY DEFAULT. This repository is PUBLIC, and git history is permanent —
# a file published here cannot be recalled from forks, clones or archives.
#
# Most of .local-docs/ is operational notes tied to specific deployment
# environments. Those stay out of the repo. Only the portable, environment-
# neutral engineering notes are allow-listed below.
#
# Adding a line here is a PUBLISHING decision, not a bookkeeping one. Read the
# file first, and check it names no organisation, product, host, account or
# network characteristic. Subdirectories are excluded wholesale on purpose:
# git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded, so anything
# added in a new subfolder stays private by default.
.local-docs/*
!.local-docs/00-README.md
!.local-docs/01-architecture.md
!.local-docs/02-design-commitments.md
!.local-docs/03-build-and-release.md
!.local-docs/04-update-flow.md
!.local-docs/05-debugging-playbook.md
!.local-docs/08-known-limitations.md
